WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:08.307
It is March.

2
00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.345
It is almost spring.

3
00:00:11.346 --> 00:00:14.145
Today I will grow an herb.

4
00:00:14.146 --> 00:00:17.296
The herb is rosemary.

5
00:00:17.297 --> 00:00:21.891
I push seeds in the dirt and cover them.

6
00:00:21.892 --> 00:00:25.301
I whisper to my tray every day.

7
00:00:25.302 --> 00:00:30.356
"Grow, Little Rosemary, grow!" I say.

8
00:00:30.357 --> 00:00:34.247
I run to Little Rosemary every day.

9
00:00:34.248 --> 00:00:37.647
I water Little Rosemary every day.

10
00:00:37.648 --> 00:00:40.993
She grows inside the dirt.

11
00:00:40.994 --> 00:00:44.890
I wait and wait.

12
00:00:44.891 --> 00:00:49.283
Then I see something green.

13
00:00:49.284 --> 00:00:51.737
I put her by the window.

14
00:00:51.738 --> 00:00:55.116
The sun shines.

15
00:00:55.117 --> 00:00:59.489
Little Rosemary grows more leaves.

16
00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:03.044
Little Rosemary smells good.

17
00:01:03.045 --> 00:01:05.904
Little Rosemary is tall.

18
00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:08.819
I take her home.

19
00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:12.120
I am glad Little Rosemary is here.

20
00:01:12.121 --> 00:01:17.254
I grew her by myself.
